ount":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fR9DyAPC1zeoUzmQTNGh4A","review_id":"wZTjQjAKqDunVqF0N0eMJg","date":"2014-12-17T19:26:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9364880323410034,"text_excerpt":"This is my neighborhood Rite Aid I suppose. It's on the way home from church so I usually stop in here after church for incidentals. Store is fairly clean. Employees are nice and helpful. Excellent nail polish selection. Sells alcohol and snack items. Doesn't seem fairly busy... I don't think I've ever had to even stand in a line. Has a parking lot and a bike rack. Perfect for in and out type shopping."},{"business_id":"fR9DyAPC1zeoUzmQTNGh4A","review_id":"E-NIQV7-19OO8limrDUp0g","date":"2014-09-10T19:10:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.931960940361023,"text_excerpt":"I used to go to the Walgreens in Lakeview for any toiletry and medical items I needed, but I found it way too expensive so I switched my business to this Rite Aid. I feel like they're a little bit cheaper, especially when you sign up for their rewards card. One thing I like about this location is that there is bike parking outside of the store on Harrison Avenue. Because it's in my neighborhood, I enjoy riding my bike to run quick errands to (1) save on gas and (2) get some exercise in. So I really appreciate that. Other than that, it's your basic drugstore offering a wide-range of products."},{"business_id":"fR9DyAPC1zeoUzmQTNGh4A","review_id":"C-el9rnm_G_3M9eg5fbYIA","date":"2017-12-17T21:15:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9287798404693604,"text_excerpt":"This Rite Aid is conveniently located on Harrison Avenue in Lakeview and has a decent sized private parking lot. The store is well stocked, and the prices are reasonable. They use the Plenti Card rewards system. They run excellent seasonal specials - as much as 50% off during the season. After season you can pick up merchandise on the cheap - like REALLY cheap. The store is clean and the staff is friendly."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
